<title>FINLAND: EFORE PROPOSES 4.0 MARKKA DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>EFORE PROPOSES 4.0 MARKKA DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to end-Oct,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    4.00 vs 8.00</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   4.19 vs 19.12</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.36 vs 11.11</p>
<p> Net sales					 183.93 vs 152.09</p>
<p> Operating profit				  3.05 vs 19.26</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.05 vs 14.08</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    54.4 vs 48.2</p>
<p>Efore said in a statement with its results for the financial</p>
<p>year to end-October its board would propose a one for ten bonus</p>
<p>issue.</p>
<p>NOTE - The full name of the Finnish electronics components</p>
<p>maker is Efore Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
